text Suddenly, my vision returns.
text I see the floor ahead of me.
text ......
text ...I can hear it.
text ...The sound of crying.
text ...The sound of a baby crying.
text When I realize what it is, I jerk my head up.
text I take a look at reality.
text I look toward the crying voice... to find a baby's red body atop a towel.
text I let go of Nagisa's hand to wrap the child in the towel and gently hold it in my arms.
text Next, I go back to hold Nagisa's hand.
setvar strS[1000] = "FGNG15E"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
