text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa...
text Nagisa's eyes are closed.
text Her face is thin and exhausted...
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa...
text I call out to her.
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa...
text Tears begin to form in my eyes...
text A moment before they begin to fall─
text I feel something squeeze my hand and return my grip.
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa!
music BGM02B.mp3
setvar strS[1000] = "FGNG15A"
