sound OX5.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...Tomoya-kun.
text Her eyes are barely open.
text They're not looking in my direction. Maybe her vision is still blurry.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm right here, Nagisa...
text I bring my face close to hers.
text Our eyes finally meet.
sound OX6.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text @I...
delay 115
text was able to do my best...
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah. That's right... You did it, Nagisa...
text @[Tomoya]
text You can hear our child crying, right...?
sound OX7.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes...
text @[Tomoya]
text Look. I'm the first one to hold it...
sound OX8.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes, it's cute...
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah... This is our child. This is Ushio.
sound OX9.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Shio-chan...
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't see anything down there, so I guess it's a girl...
text @[Tomoya]
text Right, Sanae-san...?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, I was right... It's a girl...
text @[Tomoya]
text A healthy baby girl...
sound OXA.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I'm so glad...
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah. You did a good job. You really did...
sound OXB.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes...
sound OXC.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...
sound OXD.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But...
sound OXE.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text It made me tired...
text @[Tomoya]
text Y-Yeah...
sound OXF.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text So...
sound OXG.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Let me rest for just a little bit...
