text ...
text I feel anxious.
text Nagisa's face is... worryingly pale.
if intG[0] < 13
	goto s184
fi
goto 219
label s184
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text There's a flurry of activity around me.
text What could they be doing...?
text I hear the old man screaming... and even Sanae-san's panicking voice.
text I wish they'd all be quiet.
text I want to talk quietly with Nagisa.
label 219
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey, Nagisa...
text @[Tomoya]
text Wait, Nagisa...
text @[Tomoya]
text Let's talk a little longer...
text @[Tomoya]
text You just have to listen...
sound OXI.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes...
sound OXJ.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text Look, it's our child...
text @[Tomoya]
text Yours and mine...
text @[Tomoya]
text Doesn't her face look like a monkey's face...?
text @[Tomoya]
text She's so small...
text @[Tomoya]
text Let me try calling her by her name...
text @[Tomoya]
text Ushio...
text @[Tomoya]
text It's your daddy, Ushio...
text @[Tomoya]
text This is your mommy...
text @[Tomoya]
text Haha... She ignored me.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, of course she doesn't understand what I'm saying...
text @[Nagisa]
text ...
text Nagisa isn't able to speak.
text But she holds my hand.
text She holds it tightly... so that we don't drift apart.
text @[Tomoya]
text I bet she'll grow up before we know it...
text @[Tomoya]
text We'll blink and she'll be in kindergarten...
text @[Tomoya]
text We'll be there together with her at the entrance ceremony... I bet we'll look ridiculous...
text @[Tomoya]
text We're still practically children ourselves, yet we'll have our own child with us...
text @[Tomoya]
text I bet it'll be funny...
