text Nagisa smiles too.
text @[Tomoya]
text She'll start elementary school, and then we'll go see her on parents' days and field days... We'll do it all as a family...
text @[Tomoya]
text That'll be a sight to see too...
text @[Tomoya]
text We'll probably look so silly, the two of us...
text @[Tomoya]
text I used to make fun of that kind of thing more than anyone else I knew...
