text She nods.
text @[Tomoya]
text But then, you...
text @[Tomoya]
text You kept making this girl listen to the Big Dango Family song over and over while she was inside your stomach...
text @[Tomoya]
text Now I'm afraid that she'll grow up to like it too...
text @[Tomoya]
text I hope she only inherits the cute parts of you...
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't mind if she's a little bit of a crybaby...
text @[Tomoya]
text As long as she gives it her best when she needs to.
text @[Tomoya]
text I hope she grows up to be like that...
setvar strS[1000] = "FGNG15E"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s187
