text @[Tomoya]
text I don't mind if she's clumsy or awkward...
text @[Tomoya]
text As long as she's sympathetic...
text @[Tomoya]
text And is able to work hard for other peoples' sake, not just her own.
text @[Tomoya]
text Just like... you do...
text @[Tomoya]
text I hope she...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...ends up like that...
text ...My vision is blurry.
text I hadn't noticed until now, but tears have filled my eyes.
text And there's nothing I can do to make them stop.
text Why do I feel so uneasy right now? What is this pain in my heart?
text All I want to do is talk to Nagisa in peace.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey, Nagisa...
text But... there isn't anything left to talk about.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text The strength has left Nagisa's hand.
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa... Nagisa...!
text I desperately grasp her hand back.
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa...
text @[Tomoya]
text Don't go anywhere, Nagisa...
text I half-cry the words.
text @[Tomoya]
text You told me you'd always be my side, didn't you...?
text @[Tomoya]
text That was the dream I was able to discover...
text @[Tomoya]
text I thought there was nothing to look forward to in life...
text @[Tomoya]
text That my life was stupid and boring...
text @[Tomoya]
text But then I was able to find that dream...
text @[Tomoya]
text Something that gives me hope in life...
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey, Nagisa...
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa...
text I keep calling her name.
text ...On... and on.
