text The bottom of the hill to school.
text She's there again.
text She stares at the school gates up above us.
text I hesitate to call her name.
text But I don't know why...
text What could she be thinking? She occasionally looks down at the ground and sighs.
text A long while passes.
text She... turns around to face away from the school gates.
